            "notes": "Before you choose your Power, assess the state of the match:\n\n-If the teams are relatively even and the game will likely go long, pick Hunker Down.\n-If your team is losing and the game may end quickly, pick On Me!\n-If your team is steamrolling, pick Cratered.\n\nHunker Down is the default because it's what the rest of the build is based off of. If the circumstances favor one of the other two, simply pick Hunker Down once you reach Round 5 instead and adjust your item choices accordingly.\n\nAssuming you pick Hunker Down, focus on playing closer to your team and using Biotic Field to heal teammates. This will give you a lot of ultimate charge and a lot of money for future rounds.",
