            "created_at": "2025-07-16T23:43:41.552061+00:00",
            "notes": "This round, you hopefully should have enough to buy Vanadium Injection given you got good healing and damage numbers. Put simply, this item is NUTS on Soldier, particularly for this build. Sell Multi-Tool if you need to because it really is THAT GOOD.\n\nTactical Visor is one of the worst ultimates in the game anyways, especially with no powers invested in making it worthwhile, so turning that 100% ultimate charge into a gigabuff for the rest of the round is a no-brainer with how quickly this build gets to 100%.",
