        {
            "id": "2d83b7ad-4ea8-45ec-8426-f1b3f7032356",
            "build_id": "068195af-735d-4004-af8b-0396a5cd2a5d",
            "round_number": 5,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-16T23:43:41.552061+00:00",
            "notes": "If you took On Me! or Cratered on Round 3, take Hunker Down now. Just like when we would've taken Hunker Down in Round 3, stick close to your teammates (especially with On Me!) to maximize healing value and rake in the cash.\n\nOtherwise, this is where the build goes off the rails. We take Frontliners, granting Overhealth to us and nearby allies equal to 25% of our maximum health every time we use Biotic Field. \n\nBut here's the thing: We use Biotic Field every time we deal damage with Helix Rocket. Up to twice each activation because of Double Helix. With Vanadium Injection, that can easily be upwards of 250 overhealth granted to us and EVERY NEARBY ALLY EVERY TIME WE USE HELIX ROCKETS. Which we can use every 5 seconds due to our cooldown reduction.\n\nIf you play with your team and can land homing rockets you can pretty easily win every teamfight through sheer sustain at this point. If you can't you can always just rocket jump to safety and play at range with your high damage bonuses.",
