            "created_at": "2025-07-16T23:43:41.552061+00:00",
            "notes": "We're taking On Me! if it isn't obvious. Doubling down on survivability this round, we also grab Nebula Conduit which is one of the most broken items in the game for increasing survivability, and combined with On Me! and a further increased bonus from Frontliners we're going to be basically unkillable and extending a lot of that survivability to teammates around us.\n\nIf you want you can sell one of the blues for another purple but these two items are just so important to the feel of the build that it always feels wrong when I sell them off. Commander's Clip instead of Pulse Converter is probably the least disruptive but lacks cooldown reduction and is only marginally better than Converter otherwise. It's a matter of preference.",
